config KSHIM_TOUCH_GT911
    bool "Goodix GT911 (I2C)"
    depends on KSHIM_TOUCH && KSHIM_I2C && KSHIM_REGULATOR
    default n
    help
        Goodix GT911 on I2C ("goodix,gt911", reg 0x5d or 0x14), for
        example the AYANEO Pocket S2 touchscreen on &i2c4. Selects the
        DT address with the INT level at the reset release, reads the
        product ID and configuration (0x8140, 0x8047) and reports the
        points at 0x814E/0x814F. A controller the previous bootloader left
        running is inherited without a reset. Interrupt-driven through
        the TLMM with a polling fallback.

config KSHIM_TOUCH_GT9916
    bool "Goodix GT9916 Berlin (SPI)"
    depends on KSHIM_TOUCH && KSHIM_SPI && KSHIM_REGULATOR
    default n
    help
        Goodix GT9916 ("goodix,gt9916", Berlin-D protocol) on SPI, for
        example the Qualcomm QRD8650 touchscreen on &spi4. Boot-option
        handshake, firmware version and IC information (touch data
        address) reads, checksummed touch events. Requires
        touchscreen-size-x/y in the DT. Interrupt-driven through the TLMM
        with a polling fallback.
